# Browser automation scratch profiles (test isolation; never committed).
# THE CONVENTION: every tool in tools/ puts its profile under .scratch/, so this
# ONE line covers every profile any future tool creates. The per-prefix patterns
# below are the old enumeration (BUGS.md E7) and are KEPT ONLY so profiles left
# on disk by an earlier round stay ignored. Do not add a sixth prefix; use .scratch/.
.scratch/

# --- legacy prefixes, retained for on-disk leftovers only ---
.scratch-profile*/
.scratch-pid

# Permission-comparison variant trees (built on demand; never committed)
.permcheck/
.capture-profile*/
.snap-profile*/
.tab-profile*/
.fp-profile*/
